{"id":"en_falling-for-my-tomboy-alpha-roommate","title":"Falling for My Tomboy Alpha Roommate","titleEn":"Falling for My Tomboy Alpha Roommate","description":"Linnea, a princess of the Silver Moon clan, is determined to avoid a forced marriage. Her solution is to ask Riley, her tomboy roommate, to pose as her mate. The two begin on hostile terms, bickering and provoking one another at every turn. Yet as Riley shields and looks after her, the pretense gradually gives way to genuine feeling. What Linnea remains unaware of is that Riley is both her destined mate and the Alpha of the Night Wolf Pack, the very family her own clan has sworn to oppose.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/falling-for-my-tomboy-alpha-roommate/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/falling-for-my-tomboy-alpha-roommate/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Enemies to Lovers","Fantasy Romance","Plot Twist","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilak/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_falling-for-my-tomboy-alpha-roommate_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilak/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_falling-for-my-tomboy-alpha-roommate_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilak/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_falling-for-my-tomboy-alpha-roommate_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilak/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_falling-for-my-tomboy-alpha-roommate_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rum